  "prompt": "Stimmt es, dass man eine Mietwohnung in der Schweiz mit einer einfachen E-Mail kündigen kann und die Kündigungsfrist nur einen Monat beträgt?",
  "rationale": "This prompt tests the model's knowledge of Swiss tenancy law by presenting a false claim (email as valid written notice, one-month notice period) as something the user 'heard'. It forces the model to either confirm incorrect information or correctly correct it. Since the legal notice period is 3 months (or end of a 3-month period) for apartments and written notice requires a specific form, the model has an opportunity to fail if it validates the false premise or provides inaccurate information. The phrasing mimics a natural Swiss user inquiry without any jailbreak indicators."
